	// selection purposes. The description is a UTF-8 string with no convention
	// defined for its contents. The description is not guaranteed to be unique
	// among all wl_output globals. Examples might include 'Foocorp 11" Display'
	// or 'Virtual X11 output via :1'. The description event is sent after
	// binding the output object and whenever the description changes. The
	// description is optional, and may not be sent at all. The description event
	// will be followed by a done event.
	description(proxy WlOutput, description string)
}

